  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Sustainable Production Intensification through Enhancing Partnerships of National Alliance Against Hunger and Malnutrition between Japan and African Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enhance partnerships of National Alliance Against Hunger and Malnutrition (NAAHM) between Japan and African countries, to support the growth of agricultural production in developing countries, and thereby, contribute to achieving world food and nutrition security and hunger eradication.</narrative>
